Source: psql-bm25s
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libicu-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Intelligent-Internet/psql_bm25s

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-psql-bm25s
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-psql-bm25s
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: BM25-family lexical retrieval for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 psql_bm25s implements a PostgreSQL-native access method with BM25 ranking,
 tokenization helpers, mutable-workload index maintenance, and SQL query
 interfaces.
